    DevKage Void Suite Companion v1.3
    Standalone / coexistence-first companion for DevKage + MaskShard.

    Goals:
      * Shared-state HvH core: rage, silent aim, void, server-origin prediction and anti-aim.
      * Void spam with local visual restore.
      * Void/self prediction + reusable target prediction API.
      * Coexistence-first anti-aim/spinbot without replacing CameraController or weapon-module functions.
      * Small DevKage-style UI that mirrors the main DevKage menu.
      * Safe reruns and coexistence with other executor scripts.

    Runtime exports:
      getgenv().DevKageVoidSuite
      getgenv().DevKageVoidPredict(part, origin)
      getgenv().DevKageVoidOrigin()
      getgenv().DevKageRageBot
      getgenv().DevKageSilentAim
      getgenv().DevKageAntiAim
--]]

local ENV = _G
do
    -- Opiumware compatibility: resolve getgenv without assuming the symbol is callable.
    local getter = getgenv
    if type(getter) == "function" then
        local ok, value = pcall(getter)
        if ok and type(value) == "table" then
            ENV = value
        end
    end
end

if ENV.DevKageVoidSuite and type(ENV.DevKageVoidSuite) == "table" and type(ENV.DevKageVoidSuite.Unload) == "function" then
